    "note": "RR-105: what PowerPoint reads of every chartex chart (the mc:Choice with its drawing id and chartEx relationship id masked, the chartEx part, its relationships, style and color parts and the embedded workbook; test/helpers/chartex-identity.mjs) and a digest of the import (JSON of fromPptx), for toPptx(deck, {catalogs: [gallery], imageResolver}) of two qualification decks, recorded on codex/rr-105-keynote-fixes at 4748ce45c, before the default mc:Fallback changed from a classic chart to a picture of OPF's own preview (2026-11-12, supervisor decision for the owner, vetoable). The change keeps every value; a later change that moves one is reviewed like any other pin. RR-105 (#1290), 2026-11-12, chart workbook properties: only the workbook digests moved (docProps/core.xml creator and lastModifiedBy name the deck author, else OPF; docProps/app.xml Application OPF); the mc:Choice, chartEx, relationship, style and color digests and the import digest are unchanged. The previous workbook digests are kept per deck as rr105WorkbookPropertiesPrevious."
